          "name_ru": "Инфернал Рунес",
          "parent": "tob3_ogre-black-sun",
          "ru_source": "derived"
        },
        {
          "desc": "Infused with unholy power the ogre’s weapon attacks are magical. When it hits with any weapon weapon deals an extra 2d6 necrotic (included below).",
